{
  "bookId": "hero-214003",
  "id": "bond-29316",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29316001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……莉莉奈，出什么事了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29316002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没事的话我继续睡了哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29316003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……能不能不要一直戳我的脸，这样我睡不着了啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29316004",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "轰隆隆！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29316005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29316006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你是害怕打雷吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29316007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29316008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "真是个不坦率的孩子。\n没记错的话，这是你第一次向我求助呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29316009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "有时候你显得太成熟，我会忍不住把你当初大人看待。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29316010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "其实，可以更多依靠一点我哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29316011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "肉麻死了，笨蛋。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29316012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "今晚我陪你睡吧，让我看看有什么睡前读物……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29316013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "我要听《克苏鲁的呼唤》。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29316014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
